OL,3,GNEWSATree falls on RSPCA facility
OL,4,Aduring Storm Austen
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn animal charity has said an isolation
OL,7,Ffacility has been "destroyed" by a tree
OL,8,Fwhich fell amid high winds brought by
OL,9,FStorm Austen.
OL,11,FThe RSPCA's Canterbury and District
OL,12,FAnimal Centre, in Kent, said its staff
OL,13,Fmanaged to escape unharmed and the sick
OL,14,Fkittens inside had been moved.
OL,16,FIt said it was trying to rehome the
OL,17,Fremaining small animals with "urgency"
OL,18,Fwhile it tried to recover what it
OL,19,Fcould.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
