OL,3,GNEWSATree falls on RSPCA facility
OL,4,Aduring Storm Austen
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoads, railways, ferries and flights
OL,7,Fwere affected across Kent, Surrey and
OL,8,FSussex on Friday as the first named
OL,9,Fstorm this winter moved through the
OL,10,Fregion.
